  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "World favoriting is planned, but I'd also like to bring up world blacklisting.\n\nSome worlds just crash me, it'd be convenient if I could hide these worlds from my list/search and see whether or not the world my friend is in is one that I've blacklisted (because it crashes me).\n\nAnd of course, some people may have other reasons for blacklisting a world. Reporting crashes is good, but I play desktop on a PC with an old graphics card that doesn't meet the minimum requirements, so I don't really expect the game to be optimized to work with what I have - I plan to get a new card eventually.",
